This directory contains Linux kernel module sources and Device Tree overlays
for the Sony IMX708 sensor (Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3 / 3 Wide) on the
NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano Developer Kit (p3768-0000).

All kernel driver C sources, headers, and Device Tree sources in this package
are licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 only
(SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only), matching the Linux kernel and NVIDIA
Jetson Tegra camera framework requirements.

Sensor register sequences and timing parameters are derived from the Linux
kernel IMX708 driver (Copyright (C) 2022, Raspberry Pi Ltd), NVIDIA Tegra
camera drivers (Copyright (c) 2020-2024, NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES), and
RidgeRun IMX708 Jetson integration references (Copyright (c) 2023, RidgeRun).

You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License version 2
along with this program; if not, see <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html>.
